  m_Text: Rolleroidz is an online multiplayer 3D arena shooter built in Unity WebGL,
    supporting up to 4 concurrent players in browser-based matches. The game features
    custom player movement, real-time multiplayer state synchronization, physics-based
    interactions, camera systems, UI, animation handling, and a custom cel-shaded
    rendering style.
